# The files a KnowledgeNetwork-Code run's agent may not change until a person allows it. A step
# whose commit changes one stops at a decision: Allow keeps the change, Drop puts the files back.
# This file is itself always locked.
#
# One pattern a line. * matches within a folder, ** across folders, and a pattern ending in / is
# the whole folder. Anything not listed is free.

[locked]
# The rules, and what other parties own.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.github/
# The design system's own copies: a card reads them and never edits them (CLAUDE.md).
design-system/

[named by the card]
# Allowed when the card names the file, by its path or its name.
# Every pinned count in the test suite measures the teaching corpus.
src/corpus/teachingdata.ts
